  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SGBV - RAISING COMMUNITY VOICES - PLAN LIBERIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will continue to work with community organisations to help participants be educated about Sexual and Gender-Based Violence, thereby empowering them to speak out about prevention as well as identification of the issues. The inclusion of men and boys is crucial in this program as the main perpetrators of SGBV. The program utilises their voices to improve project design for better outcomes for women and girls. The project also includes behaviour change activities for men and boys and identification of unsafe spaces in communities.</narrative>
  </description>
